<title>INDIA: India Tata Unisys 6-mth net up 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>India Tata Unisys 6-mth net up 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Software firm Tata Unisys Ltd said on Monday its net profit for the six months ended September 30, 1996, rose by 12.5 percent to 74.6 million rupees from 66.3 million a year ago.  </p>
<p>Turnover rose to 968.6 million rupees in the first half of 1996/97 (April-March) from 801.1 million. Depreciation was at 40.6 million rupees and taxation at 40.0 million, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The company continued to maintain its position as one of the largest sofware exporters in the country,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
